  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ul class=\"\"><li>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (đường chéo hình vuông).<br>\n\t\t\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>u